9
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:37,150
Um, so, before that, a bit about me.

10
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:41,050
I lead a team of nine engineers.

11
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:45,450
Change one: every meeting has a

12
00:00:45,450 --> 00:00:48,450
single question it exists to answer.

13
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,850
If you can't write the question in

14
00:00:52,850 --> 00:00:55,850
